    "Name": "Ostsol OTL-8E",
    "Details": "Developed by Robinson Standard BattleWorks shortly before it was taken by the DCMS, this Ostsol carries a Large X-Pulse Laser and Medium X-Pulse Laser in each side torso. A pair of ER Small Lasers mounted in the center torso cover the rear arc. It is protected by eleven tons of ferro-fibrous armor, and an XL engine keeps it moving at 86 km/h. To make room for this equipment and seventeen double heat sinks, engineers had to fit a Compact Gyro.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.08</color></b>",
